---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { ppfOptions } from '../data/catalog';
const officialFilms = ppfOptions.filter((film) => film.officialProduct);
---
<SiteLayout title="Rodim PPF Information & Consultation" description="Compare current Rodim PPF options with Crest Automotive Care in DLF Gurugram. Explore official Rodim product details, then plan a vehicle-specific estimate with Crest." currentPath="/rodim" pageNumber="03" pageLabel="Rodim PPF">
  <div class="rodim-page">
    <section class="rodim-hero"><div class="rodim-hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Crest Automotive Care · Rodim PPF</span><h1>Protection with a<br /><em>point of view.</em></h1><p>Compare Rodim paint protection films by finish, road use and protection intent. Crest can assess your paint condition and intended coverage before preparing a local estimate.</p><div class="rodim-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="/estimate">Build a Crest estimate <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-action" href="https://rodim.in/about-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View official Rodim details <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><small class="external-note">Rodim product pages and warranty terms are hosted and maintained by Rodim.</small></div><div class="rodim-hero-panel"><span>RODIM PPF / CREST CONSULTATION</span><strong>Choose the film<br />for the way you drive.</strong><small>Paint assessment · coverage planning · estimate</small></div></section>
    <section class="rodim-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">How to choose</span><h2>Start with the<br /><em>finish you want.</em></h2></div><p>PPF is a considered layer, not a promise against every form of damage. The right recommendation depends on the vehicle, paint condition, driving environment and the coverage you want to protect.</p></section>
    <section class="choice-grid" aria-label="Rodim PPF film intents"><article><span>01 / DAILY</span><h3>Clarity and gloss</h3><p><strong>Rodim R1</strong> is positioned by Rodim for daily-driven vehicles with high optical clarity, self-healing and UV blocking.</p></article><article><span>02 / ROAD USE</span><h3>More structural strength</h3><p><strong>Rodim R2</strong> is suited to owners seeking increased thickness, impact and scratch protection for demanding roads.</p></article><article><span>03 / PERFORMANCE</span><h3>Severe-exposure protection</h3><p><strong>Rodim R3 Pro</strong> uses an ultra-thick TPU construction for extreme impact, chemical and corrosion exposure.</p></article><article><span>04 / FINISH</span><h3>Stealth or gloss transformation</h3><p><strong>Rodim R2 Matt Finish</strong> brings a satin surface, while <strong>Rodim R2 Black</strong> creates a deep glossy black visual transformation.</p></article></section>
    <section class="film-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">The current range</span><h2>Compare the<br /><em>Rodim films.</em></h2></div><p>Explore verified product pages on Rodim.in, then keep the vehicle-specific planning and estimate with Crest.</p></div><div class="film-list">{officialFilms.map((film, index) => <article class="film-card"><div class="film-index">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</div><div><h3>{film.name}</h3><p>{film.positioning}</p><span class="film-coverage">{film.coverage}</span>{film.warranty && <small class="film-warranty">{film.warranty}</small>}</div><div class="film-links"><a href={film.officialUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View {film.name} on Rodim.in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/estimate">Build a Crest estimate <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="warranty-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">Warranty & care</span><h2>Read the terms<br /><em>before you book.</em></h2></div><div><p>Rodim’s official warranty description addresses eligible defects such as large-area cracking, blistering and adhesive residue in the Rodim TPU PPF itself, subject to its conditions and exclusions. Coverage is not unconditional: improper use, maintenance and cleaning, accidents, natural disasters, normal wear and unrelated causes are among the exclusions described by Rodim. Repainted panels may also be excluded in specified circumstances.</p><p class="warranty-disclosure">Product warranty terms, coverage, eligibility and exclusions are governed by Rodim’s official terms and installation-specific documentation. Crest does not administer or replace Rodim’s product warranty.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://rodim.in/product-warranty-service-description/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View warranty terms on Rodim.in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
    <section class="rodim-cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your Crest next step</span><h2>Assess the car.<br /><em>Then choose well.</em></h2></div><div><p>Tell Crest your model, paint condition and intended coverage. We will help you compare the range and confirm the appropriate estimate before booking.</p><a class="button button-gold" href="/contact">Talk to Crest <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.rodim-page{background:#f8f8f4;color:#17324d}.rodim-page section{padding:140px max(24px,calc((100% - 1240px)/2))}.rodim-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:70px;align-items:end;min-height:640px;background:#123d66;color:#fff}.rodim-hero-copy{max-width:700px}.rodim-hero h1{margin:22px 0;font-size:clamp(52px,7vw,96px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.07em}.rodim-hero h1 em,.rodim-intro h2 em,.film-section h2 em,.warranty-section h2 em,.rodim-cta h2 em{color:#e49b57;font-style:normal}.rodim-hero p{max-width:620px;color:#d8e5ee;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7}.rodim-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-top:34px}.rodim-hero .text-action{color:#fff}.external-note{display:block;margin-top:25px;color:#b6cbd9;font-size:11px}.rodim-hero-panel{min-height:450px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:end;padding:30px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(12,45,74,.1),rgba(12,45,74,.9)),url('/images/generated/crest-ppf-precision.jpg') center/cover;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25)}.rodim-hero-panel span,.rodim-hero-panel small{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em}.rodim-hero-panel strong{margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,44px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.05em}.rodim-hero-panel small{color:#c9d8e2}.rodim-intro,.section-heading,.warranty-section,.rodim-cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:70px;align-items:end}.rodim-intro h2,.section-heading h2,.warranty-section h2,.rodim-cta h2{margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,72px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em}.rodim-intro>p,.section-heading>p,.warranty-section>div:last-child,.rodim-cta>div:last-child{max-width:500px;color:#5d7183;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75}.choice-grid{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;padding-top:0!important}.choice-grid article{min-height:260px;padding:24px;border-top:2px solid #e49b57;background:#eff3f1}.choice-grid span,.film-index{color:#8b542e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em}.choice-grid h3{margin:56px 0 12px;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.choice-grid p,.film-card p,.warranty-section p,.rodim-cta p{color:#5d7183;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.film-section{background:#eef3f8}.film-list{margin-top:50px;border-top:1px solid #cbdcd6}.film-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:55px 1fr 290px;gap:22px;padding:28px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cbdcd6;align-items:start}.film-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.04em}.film-card p{max-width:620px;margin:0 0 14px}.film-coverage,.film-warranty{display:block;color:#385b78;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.film-warranty{margin-top:8px;color:#8b542e}.film-links{display:grid;gap:14px}.film-links a,.rodim-page .text-action{color:#385b78;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase}.film-links a:last-child{color:#8b542e}.warranty-section{background:#fff5e9;align-items:start}.warranty-section h2{font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,60px)}.warranty-section>div:last-child{max-width:650px}.warranty-disclosure{padding:18px 20px;border-left:2px solid #e49b57;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);color:#385b78!important}.rodim-cta{background:#0c2d4a;color:#fff}.rodim-cta>div:last-child{color:#d8e5ee}.rodim-cta p{color:#d8e5ee}.rodim-cta .eyebrow{color:#e49b57}.rodim-cta h2{font-size:clamp(44px,5vw,72px)}@media(max-width:900px){.rodim-hero,.rodim-intro,.section-heading,.warranty-section,.rodim-cta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.choice-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important}.film-card{grid-template-columns:45px 1fr}.film-links{grid-column:2;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}}@media(max-width:620px){.rodim-page section{padding:80px 20px}.rodim-hero{padding-top:110px}.rodim-hero-panel{min-height:330px}.rodim-hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,64px)}.rodim-hero p{font-size:16px}.choice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.choice-grid article{min-height:0}.choice-grid h3{margin-top:32px}.film-card h3{font-size:22px}.film-links{display:grid}.rodim-intro h2,.section-heading h2,.warranty-section h2,.rodim-cta h2{font-size:44px}}
</style>
<style is:global>
  /* Rodim blue panels need an ink reversal: never allow the light-site overrides to create blue-on-blue text. */
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero p,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .eyebrow,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .external-note,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta p,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .eyebrow { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero h1 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta h2 em,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .eyebrow,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .eyebrow { color: #f0b275 !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .text-action,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero .text-action:hover,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .text-action,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-cta .text-action:hover { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel strong,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel span,
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel small { color: #fff !important; }
  body main .rodim-page .rodim-hero-panel span { color: #f0b275 !important; }
</style>
